 Information Technology Act, 2000, and the rules thereunder as applicable and the amended provisions pertaining to electronic records in various statutes as amended by the Information Technology Act, 2000. This electronic record is generated by a computer system and does not require any physical or digital signatures.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cli\\u003eAll decisions relating to the Offer made at the discretion of HSBC shall be final, binding and no contestable. Other than the specific entitlements available to the Cardholders under this Offer, any other claims regarding this Offer, against HSBC, are waived.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cli\\u003eHSBC reserves the sole right to decide on whether a purchase meets the eligibility criteria listed above.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cli\\u003eThis Offer is subject to force majeure clauses.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cli\\u003eTax liability, if any, will be borne by the Cardholder.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cli\\u003eThe Offer is valid only in India for adults of a sound mind.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cli\\u003eThis Offer shall be subjected to all applicable central and/or state laws, rules and regulations.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cli\\u003ePlease note that basis the Goods and Services Tax (GST) regulations and notified GST rates, Central GST and State/ Union Territory GST or Inter-State GST, will be levied on the discounted price, as applicable.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cli\\u003eBy participating in the Offer, Cardholders shall be deemed to have read, understood and expressly accepted all the aforementioned Offer Terms in their totality.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003c/ol\\u003e\\u0026#10;\\u0026#10; \\u003ctable border=\\\"1\\\" cellpadding=\\\"8\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\"\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cthead\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003ctr\\u003e\\u003cth bgcolor=\\\"#db0011\\\"\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eProduct list\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003c/th\\u003e\\